{"headword":"יְהוֹנָדָב","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>is noble</em>, or <em>is liberal</em>, or <em>hath impelled</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, נְדַבְיָה\" href=\"/BDB,_נְדַבְיָה\", dir=\"rtl\">נְדַבְיָה</a><strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> son of Rechab & chief of the Rechabites (𝔊 Ἰωναδαβ) <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.15\">2 K 10:15</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 35:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.35.8\">Je 35:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 35:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.35.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 35:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.35.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 35:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.35.18\">18</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 35:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.35.6\">Je 35:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 35:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.35.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 35:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.35.19\">19</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> nephew of David (𝔊 Ἰωναδαβ, Ἰωναδαμ; 𝔊L Ἰωναθαν) <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.5\">2 S 13:5</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.3\">2 S 13:3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:32\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.32\">32</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:35\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.35\">35</a>; (appar. called Jonathan <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.21\">2 S 21:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.7\">1 Ch 20:7</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, יְהוֹנָתָן\" href=\"/BDB,_יְהוֹנָתָן\", dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹנָתָן</a> <strong>3.</strong>)"}],"num":"2."}]},"rid":"BDB02339","strong_numbers":["3082","3122"],"next_hw":"יְהוֹנָתָן","prev_hw":"יְהוּכַל","all_cited":true,"alt_headwords":[{"word":"יוֹנָדָב"}],"quotes":[],"GK":["3386","3432"],"T